{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":14.96},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.04,"end":28.32},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30.16,"end":40.88}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":4.88,"text":"尋路系統把位置表示成節點、允許的移動表示成邊。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":5.76,"end":9.44,"text":"這個迷宮只允許相鄰空格間等成本移動。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.4,"end":11.52,"text":"牆會移除連接，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.787,"end":14.96,"text":"因此畫面上靠近不代表可以到達。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.04,"end":17.76,"text":"查看起點與終點，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":18.16,"end":20,"text":"切換一面內部牆壁。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.64,"end":22.4,"text":"觀察端點不變時，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":22.52,"end":24.24,"text":"可行路徑是否改變。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":26,"end":28.32,"text":"迷宮圖中的一條邊代表什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":30.16,"end":32.72,"text":"迷宮圖中的一條邊代表什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.16,"end":37.92,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":38.4,"end":40.88,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}